  "worked_solution": "Since the angles $∠AJI$ and $∠CIF$ are corresponding angles, they are congruent and therefore have the same measure:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠AJI & =m∠CIF \\\\ x+{23}^{∘} & =2x-{1}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we have an equation that we can solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+{23}^{∘} & =2x-{1}^{∘} \\\\ {23}^{∘} & =x-{1}^{∘} \\\\ {24}^{∘} & =x \\\\ x & ={24}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
